'''Oruo The Almighty''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Continuum}}. They allow the player to fight {{MobSprite|Sun Gecko}} and apply modifiers to the {{zone|Time Chamber}}. They have an [[Essence Shops|Essence Shop]] where the player can purchase perks and items for {{Item|Sun Gecko Essence}}.

